              "zh": "及何無忌為徐道覆所害，賊乘勝逼京師，朝廷震駭，長民率眾人衛京都，因表曰：「妖賊集船伐木，而南康相郭澄之隱蔽經年，又深相保"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p119",
          "en": "Xu Daofu",
          "descriptor": "Rebel",
          "units": [
            "s0251"
          ],
          "unitSnippets": [
            {
              "id": "s0251",
              "zh": "盧循遣別帥徐道覆順流而下，舟艦皆重樓。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chineseName": "庾悅",
      "englishName": "Yu Yue",
      "localIds": [
        "p051",
        "p074"
      ],
      "sourceAdjudication": "same-person-by-source: exact Chinese name and chapter narrative treat these as one historical actor across section-local extractions; do not silently certify canonical membership without native identity review.",
      "unresolvedIdentity": true,
      "mergeApplied": false,
      "locals": [
        {
          "id": "p051",
          "en": "Yu Yue",
          "descriptor": "Official",
          "units": [
            "s0098",
            "s0100"
          ],
          "unitSnippets": [
            {
              "id": "s0098",
              "zh": "刺史庾悅，自臨蒞以來，甚有恤隱之誠，但綱維不革，自非綱目所理。"
            },
            {
              "id": "s0100",
              "zh": "於是解悅，毅移鎮豫章，遣其親將趙恢領千兵守尋陽。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p074",
          "en": "Yu Yue",
          "descriptor": "Official",
          "units": [
            "s0143",
            "s0144",
            "s0145",
            "s0146",
            "s0147",
            "s0149",
            "s0150"
          ],
          "unitSnippets": [
            {
              "id": "s0143",
              "zh": "初，江州刺史庾悅，隆安中為司徒長史，曾至京口。"
            },
            {
              "id": "s0144",
              "zh": "毅時甚屯窶，先就府借東堂與親故出射。"
            },
            {
              "id": "s0145",
              "zh": "而悅後與僚佐徑來詣堂，毅告之曰：「毅輩屯否之人，合一射甚難。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chineseName": "殷仲堪",
      "englishName": "Yin Zhongkan",
      "localIds": [
        "p076",
        "p135"
      ],
      "sourceAdjudication": "same-person-by-source: exact Chinese name and chapter narrative treat these as one historical actor across section-local extractions; do not silently certify canonical membership without native identity review.",
      "unresolvedIdentity": true,
      "mergeApplied": false,
      "locals": [
        {
          "id": "p076",
          "en": "Yin Zhongkan",
          "descriptor": "Official",
          "units": [
            "s0153",
            "s0158",
            "s0159",
            "s0161"
          ],
          "unitSnippets": [
            {
              "id": "s0153",
              "zh": "少有才幹，為殷仲堪中兵參軍。"
            },
            {
              "id": "s0158",
              "zh": "仲堪為之失色，玄出，仲堪謂邁曰：「卿乃狂人也！"
            },
            {
              "id": "s0159",
              "zh": "玄夜遣殺卿，我豈能相救！」"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p135",
          "en": "Yin Zhongkan",
          "descriptor": "Official",
          "units": [
            "s0304"
          ],
          "unitSnippets": [
            {
              "id": "s0304",
              "zh": "年十八，聞荊州刺史殷仲堪帳下有名醫能療之，貧無行裝，謂家人曰：「殘醜如此，用活何為！」"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "chineseName": "諸葛長民",
      "englishName": "Zhuge Changmin",
      "localIds": [
        "p078",
        "p088",
        "p142"
      ],
      "sourceAdjudication": "same-person-by-source: exact Chinese name and chapter narrative treat these as one historical actor across section-local extractions; do not silently certify canonical membership without native identity review.",
      "unresolvedIdentity": true,
      "mergeApplied": false,
      "locals": [
        {
          "id": "p078",
          "en": "Zhuge Changmin",
          "descriptor": "General",
          "units": [
            "s0169",
            "s0171",
            "s0172",
            "s0173",
            "s0174",
            "s0175",
            "s0176",
            "s0178",
            "s0180"
          ],
          "unitSnippets": [
            {
              "id": "s0169",
              "zh": "諸葛長民，琅邪陽都人也。"
            },
            {
              "id": "s0171",
              "zh": "桓玄引為參軍平西軍事，尋以貪刻免。"
            },
            {
              "id": "s0172",
              "zh": "及劉裕建義，與之定謀，為揚武將軍。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p088",
          "en": "Zhuge Changmin",
          "descriptor": "General",
          "units": [
            "s0181",
            "s0182",
            "s0183",
            "s0184",
            "s0185",
            "s0188",
            "s0189",
            "s0192",
            "s0193"
          ],
          "unitSnippets": [
            {
              "id": "s0181",
              "zh": "及裕討毅，以長民監太尉留府事，詔以甲杖五十人入殿。"
            },
            {
              "id": "s0182",
              "zh": "長民驕縱貪侈，不恤政事，多聚珍寶美色，營建第宅，不知紀極，所在殘虐，為百姓所苦。"
            },
            {
              "id": "s0183",
              "zh": "自以多行無禮，恆懼國憲。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "p142",
          "en": "Zhuge Changmin",
          "descriptor": "General",
          "units": [
            "s0334",
            "s0336"
          ],
          "unitSnippets": [
            {
              "id": "s0334",
              "zh": "然希樂陵傲而速禍，諸葛驕淫以成釁，造宋而乖同德，復晉而異純臣，謀之不臧，自取夷滅。"
            },
            {
              "id": "s0336",
              "zh": "贊曰：劉生剛愎，葛侯凶恣。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
